sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin
    participant FE as HROS Web
    participant API as UserGroupController
    participant UG as UserGroupModule
    participant Match as MatchingEngine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Outbox as Outbox

    Admin->>FE: Configure User Group
    FE->>API: Preview User Group

    API->>UG: validate configuration
    UG->>Match: estimate matching population
    Match->>DB: Evaluate employee projection
    DB-->>Match: Matching employees
    Match-->>UG: matching count
    UG-->>API: Preview result
    API-->>FE: Matching count

    Admin->>FE: Save
    FE->>API: POST User Group

    API->>UG: create()
    UG->>DB: BEGIN
    UG->>DB: Insert User Group + criteria + scope + assignments
    UG->>Outbox: Append audit event
    UG->>DB: COMMIT

    UG-->>API: Created
    API-->>FE: 201 Created
